     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi all, I am still quite new to SEM (especially anything more complex than a CFA) and I have been trying two different identification approaches for my factor-of-curves model. <br></div><div><br></div><div>- All variables are continuous. [&quot;tot&quot;, despite its name, is not a sum of the other two variables or anything of the sort, it&#39;s just another continuous variable.]</div><div>- N = 1084, but I have various missing data at various time points, so I&#39;m using the   missing = &quot;ML&quot;   argument </div><div><br></div><div>The first model I specified is the following:<br></div><div>model1 &lt;- &#39;<br>#growth curves<br></div><div>Imat =~ 1*mat_w1 + 1*mat_w2 + 1*mat_w3 + 1*mat_w4<br>Smat =~ 0*mat_w1 + 2.96*mat_w2 + 6.71*mat_w3 + 9.8*mat_w4</div><div><br></div><div>Iblk =~ 1*blk_w1 + 1*blk_w2 + 1*blk_w3 + 1*blk_w4<br>Sblk=~ 0*blk_w1 + 2.96*blk_w2 + 6.71*blk_w3 + 9.8*blk_w4</div><div><br></div><div>Itot =~ 1*tot_w1 + 1*tot_w2 + 1*tot_w3 + 1*tot_w4<br>Stot=~ 0*tot_w1 + 2.96*tot_w2 + 6.71*tot_w3 + 9.8*tot_w4</div><div><br></div><div>#domain parameters<br>Iv =~ NA*Imat + Iblk + Itot<br>Sv =~ NA*Smat + Sblk + Stot</div><div><br></div><div>#lv as scaling reference: var=1, int=0<br>Iv ~~ 1*Iv<br>Sv ~~ 1*Sv</div><div>Iv ~ 0*1<br>Sv ~ 0*1<br></div><div><br></div><div>#estimate covariances between lv for each task<br>Imat ~~ Smat<br>Iblk~~ Sblk<br>Itot ~~ Stot<br>&#39;<br></div><div>fit1 &lt;- growth(model1,dset1, missing = &quot;ML&quot;)<br></div><div><br></div><div>This simply throws the warning: &quot;lavaan WARNING: some estimated lv variances are negative&quot;, but otherwise works fine. The negative variances (Smat and Stot) are not significantly different from 0 and model fit indices are good or very good. Fixing those two variances at 0 makes the warning disappear and doesn&#39;t really affect fit indices</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>This is the alternative model<br></div><div>model2 &lt;- &#39;<br>#growth curves<br><div>Imat =~ 1*mat_w1 + 1*mat_w2 + 1*mat_w3 + 1*mat_w4<br>Smat =~ 0*mat_w1 + 2.96*mat_w2 + 6.71*mat_w3 + 9.8*mat_w4</div><div><br></div><div>Iblk =~ 1*blk_w1 + 1*blk_w2 + 1*blk_w3 + 1*blk_w4<br>Sblk=~ 0*blk_w1 + 2.96*blk_w2 + 6.71*blk_w3 + 9.8*blk_w4</div><div><br></div><div>Itot =~ 1*tot_w1 + 1*tot_w2 + 1*tot_w3 + 1*tot_w4<br>Stot=~ 0*tot_w1 + 2.96*tot_w2 + 6.71*tot_w3 + 9.8*tot_w4</div></div><div><br></div><div>#domain parameters (first indicator load = 1 by growth default)<br><span style=\"display:inline!important;float:none;background-color:transparent;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\">Iv =~ Imat + Iblk + Itot</span><br><span style=\"display:inline!important;float:none;background-color:transparent;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\">Sv =~ Smat + Sblk + Stot</span><b></b><i></i><u></u><sub></sub><sup></sup><strike></strike><br></div><div><br></div><div>#lv as scaling reference for the mean: int=0<br>Iv ~ 0*1<br>Sv ~ 0*1</div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"display:inline!important;float:none;background-color:transparent;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\">#estimate covariances between lv for each task</span><br><span style=\"display:inline!important;float:none;background-color:transparent;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\">Imat ~~ Smat</span><br><span style=\"display:inline!important;float:none;background-color:transparent;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\">Iblk~~ Sblk</span><br><span style=\"display:inline!important;float:none;background-color:transparent;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\">Itot ~~ Stot</span><br>&#39;<br></div><div><span style=\"display:inline!important;float:none;background-color:transparent;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\">fit2 &lt;- growth(model2, dset1,</span><span style=\"display:inline!important;float:none;background-color:transparent;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"> missing = &quot;ML&quot;)</span></div><div><b></b><i></i><u></u><sub></sub><sup></sup><strike></strike><br></div><div>However, in this case I get &quot;lavaan WARNING: the optimizer warns that a solution has NOT been found!&quot;, and consequently no St. Error estimation and no fit indices for my model.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Finally, if I use what I learned from model1 about negative lv variances and define model2.1 accordingly:<br></div><div><div>model2.1 &lt;- &#39;<br>#growth curves<br><div style=\"background-color:transparent;border-bottom-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-bottom-style:none;border-bottom-width:0px;border-left-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-left-style:none;border-left-width:0px;border-right-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-right-style:none;border-right-width:0px;border-top-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-top-style:none;border-top-width:0px;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:0px;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\">Imat =~ 1*mat_w1 + 1*mat_w2 + 1*mat_w3 + 1*mat_w4<br style=\"background-clip:border-box;background-color:transparent;background-image:none;background-origin:padding-box;background-repeat:repeat;background-size:auto;border-bottom-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-bottom-style:none;border-bottom-width:0px;border-left-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-left-style:none;border-left-width:0px;border-right-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-right-style:none;border-right-width:0px;border-top-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-top-style:none;border-top-width:0px;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:13px;min-height:auto;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;min-width:0px;overflow:visible;overflow-x:visible;overflow-y:visible;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:0px\">Smat =~ 0*mat_w1 + 2.96*mat_w2 + 6.71*mat_w3 + 9.8*mat_w4</div><div style=\"background-color:transparent;border-bottom-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-bottom-style:none;border-bottom-width:0px;border-left-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-left-style:none;border-left-width:0px;border-right-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-right-style:none;border-right-width:0px;border-top-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-top-style:none;border-top-width:0px;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:0px;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"><br></div><div style=\"background-color:transparent;border-bottom-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-bottom-style:none;border-bottom-width:0px;border-left-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-left-style:none;border-left-width:0px;border-right-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-right-style:none;border-right-width:0px;border-top-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-top-style:none;border-top-width:0px;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:0px;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\">Iblk =~ 1*blk_w1 + 1*blk_w2 + 1*blk_w3 + 1*blk_w4<br style=\"background-clip:border-box;background-color:transparent;background-image:none;background-origin:padding-box;background-repeat:repeat;background-size:auto;border-bottom-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-bottom-style:none;border-bottom-width:0px;border-left-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-left-style:none;border-left-width:0px;border-right-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-right-style:none;border-right-width:0px;border-top-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-top-style:none;border-top-width:0px;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:13px;min-height:auto;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;min-width:0px;overflow:visible;overflow-x:visible;overflow-y:visible;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:0px\">Sblk=~ 0*blk_w1 + 2.96*blk_w2 + 6.71*blk_w3 + 9.8*blk_w4</div><div style=\"background-color:transparent;border-bottom-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-bottom-style:none;border-bottom-width:0px;border-left-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-left-style:none;border-left-width:0px;border-right-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-right-style:none;border-right-width:0px;border-top-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-top-style:none;border-top-width:0px;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:0px;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"><br></div><div style=\"background-color:transparent;border-bottom-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-bottom-style:none;border-bottom-width:0px;border-left-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-left-style:none;border-left-width:0px;border-right-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-right-style:none;border-right-width:0px;border-top-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-top-style:none;border-top-width:0px;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:0px;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\">Itot =~ 1*tot_w1 + 1*tot_w2 + 1*tot_w3 + 1*tot_w4<br style=\"background-clip:border-box;background-color:transparent;background-image:none;background-origin:padding-box;background-repeat:repeat;background-size:auto;border-bottom-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-bottom-style:none;border-bottom-width:0px;border-left-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-left-style:none;border-left-width:0px;border-right-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-right-style:none;border-right-width:0px;border-top-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-top-style:none;border-top-width:0px;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:13px;min-height:auto;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;min-width:0px;overflow:visible;overflow-x:visible;overflow-y:visible;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:0px\">Stot=~ 0*tot_w1 + 2.96*tot_w2 + 6.71*tot_w3 + 9.8*tot_w4</div></div><div><br></div><div>#domain parameters (first indicator load = 1 by growth default)<br><span>Iv =~ Imat + Iblk + Itot</span><br style=\"background-clip:border-box;background-color:transparent;background-image:none;background-origin:padding-box;background-repeat:repeat;background-size:auto;border-bottom-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-bottom-style:none;border-bottom-width:0px;border-left-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-left-style:none;border-left-width:0px;border-right-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-right-style:none;border-right-width:0px;border-top-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-top-style:none;border-top-width:0px;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;min-height:auto;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;min-width:0px;overflow:visible;overflow-x:visible;overflow-y:visible;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:0px;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"><span>Sv =~ Smat + Sblk + Stot</span><b></b><i></i><u></u><sub style=\"border-bottom-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-bottom-style:none;border-bottom-width:0px;border-left-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-left-style:none;border-left-width:0px;border-right-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-right-style:none;border-right-width:0px;border-top-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-top-style:none;border-top-width:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:0px\"></sub><sup style=\"border-bottom-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-bottom-style:none;border-bottom-width:0px;border-left-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-left-style:none;border-left-width:0px;border-right-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-right-style:none;border-right-width:0px;border-top-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-top-style:none;border-top-width:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:0px\"></sup><strike style=\"border-bottom-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-bottom-style:none;border-bottom-width:0px;border-left-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-left-style:none;border-left-width:0px;border-right-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-right-style:none;border-right-width:0px;border-top-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-top-style:none;border-top-width:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:0px\"></strike><br></div><div><br></div><div>#lv as scaling reference for the mean: int=0<br>Iv ~ 0*1<br>Sv ~ 0*1</div><div><br></div><div><span>#estimate covariances between lv for each task (not for var = 0)</span><br style=\"background-clip:border-box;background-color:transparent;background-image:none;background-origin:padding-box;background-repeat:repeat;background-size:auto;border-bottom-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-bottom-style:none;border-bottom-width:0px;border-left-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-left-style:none;border-left-width:0px;border-right-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-right-style:none;border-right-width:0px;border-top-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-top-style:none;border-top-width:0px;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;min-height:auto;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;min-width:0px;overflow:visible;overflow-x:visible;overflow-y:visible;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:0px;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px rgb(34,34,34);text-align:left;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;word-spacing:0px;display:inline;white-space:normal;float:none;background-color:transparent\"><b># Imat ~~ Smat</b></span><br style=\"background-clip:border-box;background-color:transparent;background-image:none;background-origin:padding-box;background-repeat:repeat;background-size:auto;border-bottom-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-bottom-style:none;border-bottom-width:0px;border-left-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-left-style:none;border-left-width:0px;border-right-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-right-style:none;border-right-width:0px;border-top-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-top-style:none;border-top-width:0px;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;min-height:auto;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;min-width:0px;overflow:visible;overflow-x:visible;overflow-y:visible;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:0px;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"><span>Iblk~~ Sblk</span><br style=\"background-clip:border-box;background-color:transparent;background-image:none;background-origin:padding-box;background-repeat:repeat;background-size:auto;border-bottom-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-bottom-style:none;border-bottom-width:0px;border-left-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-left-style:none;border-left-width:0px;border-right-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-right-style:none;border-right-width:0px;border-top-color:rgb(34,34,34);border-top-style:none;border-top-width:0px;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;min-height:auto;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;min-width:0px;overflow:visible;overflow-x:visible;overflow-y:visible;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:0px;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px rgb(34,34,34);text-align:left;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;word-spacing:0px;display:inline;white-space:normal;float:none;background-color:transparent\"><b># Itot ~~ Stot</b></span><br><b></b><br></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px rgb(34,34,34);text-align:left;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:13px;font-variant:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:transparent\"><b><span style=\"text-align:left;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;word-spacing:0px;display:inline!important;white-space:normal;float:none;background-color:transparent\">#fix negative lv variances at 0</span><br style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px rgb(34,34,34);min-height:auto;text-align:left;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;overflow:visible;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;overflow-x:visible;overflow-y:visible;min-width:0px\"><span style=\"text-align:left;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;word-spacing:0px;display:inline!important;white-space:normal;float:none;background-color:transparent\">Stot ~~ 0*Stot</span><br style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px rgb(34,34,34);min-height:auto;text-align:left;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;overflow:visible;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;overflow-x:visible;overflow-y:visible;min-width:0px\"><span style=\"text-align:left;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;word-spacing:0px;display:inline!important;white-space:normal;float:none;background-color:transparent\">Smat ~~ 0*Smat</span></b><i></i><u></u><sub></sub><sup></sup><strike></strike><br></div><div>&#39;</div><span>fit2.1 &lt;- growth(model2.1, dset1,</span><span>  missing = &quot;ML&quot;)</span><b></b><i></i><u></u><sub></sub><sup></sup><strike></strike><br></div><div> </div><div>At this point, model2.1 works fine, converges and gives results equivalent to those of model1</div><div><br></div><div>QUESTIONS</div><div>1) If those two &quot;negative&quot; variances are the problem, why does model 1 work at least somewhat fine, and model 2 completely fail to converge?</div><div>2) What kind of information should I try to extract from model 2 in order to identify the problem (Seeing as it&#39;s not throwing a nice, detailed, informative warning as model 1 did)? <br>    I tried with lavInspect(fit2, &quot;<a href=\"http://cor.lv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cor.lv&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792422299034000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3zxGlpJQUObBmJS-8_Nz5h\">cor.lv</a>&quot;) and something is clearly off, but I wouldn&#39;t have been able to look at this and know how to fix it, if I hadn&#39;t run model 1 beforehand<br></div><div> </div><div> </div><blockquote style=\"padding:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px\" dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote style=\"padding:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px\" dir=\"ltr\"><div><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap!important;line-height:1.2;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:-webkit-left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap!important\">Imat  1.000                                                 \r\nSmat -0.162  1.000                                          \r\nIblk  0.765  0.001  1.000                                   \r\nSblk   0.000 -0.004 -0.174  1.000                            \r\nItot  0.635  0.001  0.637  0.000  1.000                     \r\nStot    NaN    NaN    NaN    NaN    NaN  1.000              \r\nIv      0.873  0.001  0.876  0.000  0.727    NaN  1.000       \r\nSv        NaN    NaN    NaN    NaN    NaN    NaN    NaN  1.000</span></span><br></pre></div></blockquote></blockquote><div></div><div><b></b><i></i><u></u><sub></sub><sup></sup><strike></strike><br></div><div><font color=\"#000000\">2.1) Does a correlation matrix like the above mean that Stot and Sv probably have a negative variance? (also, note so far it has been Smat, and not Sv, to have an estimated negative variance)</font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\">I guess what I&#39;m trying to ask is: in the future, if I find myself in a &quot;model 2&quot; situation, how do I identify the problem? Do I have to try and specify the model in another way, or is there something else to look at?</font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\">3) I know I still make basic mistakes and fail to notice them, so maybe the issue comes from somewhere else entirely?</font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\">Thanks for any kind of help</font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\">Federica</font><br></div><div><br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
